--
The type of a non-type template parameter of a friend function template
defined in a class template named the enclosing template's parameter
(`It'), which was unbound once the friend was converted at namespace
scope.  The MSVC STL's reverse_iterator declares _Verify_range this way
(cpp17_equal_reverse_iterator_crash on VS 2022).
